{"parse": {"title": "RUG-01", "pageid": 23011, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RUG-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/RUG-02\" title=\"RUG-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RUG</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BF.BB.E6.BB.9A.E7.A2.B0.E7.A2.B0.E8.BD.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"翻滚碰碰车\">翻滚碰碰车</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 翻滚碰碰车</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Roller Coaster</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>碰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>撞<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>段<span class=\"color-value\"></span>故<span class=\"color-value\"></span>事<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>开<span class=\"color-value\"></span>始<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>条<span class=\"color-value\"></span>漫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>长<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>医<span class=\"color-value\"></span>疗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>缴<span class=\"color-value\"></span>费<span class=\"color-value\"></span>单<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1510101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">答录机：</div><div>嗨，你好。这儿是沙丝绒的家。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lvguan\"><img alt=\"lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/600px-Cg-lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/900px-Cg-lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">答录机：</div><div>我现在不在家，又或是没空接电话，如果你想联系我，请在“滴”声后留言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">答录机：</div><div>嘿！还有二十分钟比赛就要开场了！你跑哪儿去了？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">答录机：</div><div>如果你不是死了，就快给我滚过来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">答录机：</div><div>好吧，好吧，我知道你对运动没什么兴趣，但你起码真的很缺钱——不是吗？！不然你也不会来找我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间中漆黑一片，厚遮光窗帘的那侧是一个漂亮的大晴天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-307517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-307517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-307517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">答录机：</div><div>如果你今天放我鸽子，我们两个就都完了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-307517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-307517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-307517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>呃……咳咳，吵死了……有什么事儿周四再说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">答录机：</div><div>周四的比赛是最重要的比赛，我一定会因此被开除的——求你了，该死的……快点儿过来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>周……四？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鼓囊囊的被窝与床铺夹层之中，两足行走的动物将自己从梦境的泥潭中拔出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>等等——周四？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惊吓如同迎头而来的一盆冷水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她错过得太多了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"waijiejiedao\"><img alt=\"waijiejiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/600px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/900px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-waijiejiedao.png/1200px-Cg-waijiejiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“错过”是一件很容易的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……我们错过了正确的路口，这和地图上写的不一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>宽檐帽先生给我们的地图太老了，已经不能用了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>很好。又一次。我们已经走错了……嗯，四次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>鉴于我短暂的生命需要为这个世界所有活物创造巨大价值——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>圣洛夫应该为我找个更靠谱点的保镖，也让澳大利亚的接洽人准备一份更合理的地图！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我就是那儿最好且唯一能保证你安全的“保镖”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>拉普拉斯很重视你，他们不想让你经历……任何危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>城市变化得很快，地图也一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们可以退回上一个路口，或者继续向前，300米后有一条小路，能够直达翻滚鳄书籍专卖店。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你需要看看地图吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>以科研者的身份出发，一个方法行不通，就换下一个——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>噢，这不就来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>打街拐角冒出头来的小姑娘被拦个正好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>嘿！等一下——可……燃点小姐，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>唔——嗯？你是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……我们——我们认识吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的鼻尖有汗，两只脚依然保持着运动的姿态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一枚写着名字的“好朋友徽章”别在她的胸前，她显然没意识到这一点。</div></div><div class=\"tabber\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first style-choice\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 6px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"1\">不，不认识</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"2\">你知道翻滚鳄书籍专卖店吗？</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"1\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们刚到达澳大利亚不久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>但我们已经迷失了很久-很久，太久了。久到对人类产生危害。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兔毛手袋将手臂搭在女学生的肩膀上，轻微地摇动着她的身体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>而你，可以使用你生命中不值一提的几分钟或几小时为全人类带来帮助——带我们去找“翻滚鳄”。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"2\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>很抱歉打扰你，我们在找一家书店。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>它的名字叫翻滚鳄，在招牌上悬挂着一只鳄鱼皮制的手鼓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>而其中，藏着我所需要的菌菇类魔药分析残本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>如果不是为了那个——没有人想来这么一大块儿空地上散步。更何况这里也没有飞盘。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>翻滚鳄？翻滚……啊！我在晨跑训练时会路过那间店！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>从这里向前走，绕过一家橘色招牌的咖啡馆，从右侧巷子进去就能找到它了！但得注意低头，那儿的招牌可容易撞到人的脑袋了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>如果你们担心的话，我可以带着你们……啊！不好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“滴。滴滴。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我的热身时间快结束了！我得走啦，我的教练还等着我做挥拳训练呢——抱歉了，希望你们一切顺利！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>谢谢你……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>让开！让开！让出一条路来——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>不用谢，只是一点儿小忙！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那模糊的声音逼近的同时，面前的年轻姑娘留下一声清脆的回答，继续踏上训练的路途。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>等等！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>拐角后面好像有个人——小心别撞——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-307514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-307514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-307514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>呃啊啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>救、救命啊……！呜哇！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-307310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-307310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-307310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……火？着……火了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>意识不清，生命体征微弱……我们得把人带回拉普拉斯去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我——呜……呃……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-woshi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"woshi_ye\"><img alt=\"woshi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/600px-Cg-woshi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/900px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/Cg-woshi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-woshi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我、我没事儿……！我不会有事儿的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307315.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-307315.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307315.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307315.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-307315.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307315.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-307315.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307315.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>呼……哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>辗转反侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我……到底是怎么了呀……难道我真的撞坏了身上的什么地方吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>虽然他们说我晕倒了，可我一点儿感觉都没有呀……除开衣服弄脏了之外，浑身上下也没有一个地方是痛的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一遍又一遍，年轻的小姑娘把床单搅得像一团皱褶的纸巾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>或许我需要更多冰水？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她灌下几口冰水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>呜——不对，或许我需要一些热茶……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她又啜饮了几口烧得翻滚的红茶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>呃……真讨厌，这一点儿用也没有！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>早知道我就该和那些奇怪的人一起去什么“拉普拉师”检查一下身体，我记得他们给我的名片还在……不，不对！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我都那样拒绝过了，如果这时候去找他们……呃呜……这太丢人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>而且——我撞到的是头，现在不舒服的却是胃，这一定只是……巧合而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我——我很少吃垃圾食品，也一直不懈怠校队的训练，我了解我的身体，它健康！而且强韧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻姑娘甩了甩脑袋，自我安慰着从枕头下抽出一本相册。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我已经吃了胃药了，只要休息一会儿，转移开我的注意力……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>硬纸壳向两侧摊开，有风从其中吹出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307316.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307316.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……呼，泥土与矿物的味道，还有炭火与金蒲桃的味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307316.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307316.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>总感觉闻到这股味道，就已经好受多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每个人都有自己的放松方式。可燃点也是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她吮吸着相册中的微风，手指顺着相片的边缘抚摸。里头乘着扫帚飞在空中的神秘学家面颊绯红，正为自己的胜利高声欢呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307316.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307316.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>这是……我的第一张收藏。妈妈在我五岁生日时送给我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307316.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307316.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-307316.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307316.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>1884年的神秘学家中正流行越树跳高，那是所有乌卢鲁运动会中树木最多的一场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>然后是1900年，圣洛夫基金会接手了乌卢鲁运动会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>为了安全考虑，他们停止了三分之一的危险运动，并为留存的项目增添了许多规范。琼斯在这场比赛上拿下了第一名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>然后是……1938年，圣洛夫基金会接手后最成功的一届“乌卢鲁运动会”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>几乎所有人都以为它将被复兴，重新回到大家眼前，直到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点小声地叹息一声，不厚的相册已翻到了最底页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>哪怕只去一分钟也行，我也想亲眼看看乌卢鲁运动场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>就像……就像……就像我从前在里头主持开幕式时一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>那时候，我站在最高的高台上，用香膏浸染炙热的火焰，坐在红木树枝上推行木舟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>而火焰与我争辩，我愤怒得浑身发抖，因为……因为她不讲道理，是一个讨厌鬼，紧接着，我的眼前只剩下漆黑——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……我？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点不自觉地挠了挠胸口，紧接着是喉咙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我刚刚说了什么？那些东西怎么在我脑袋里——那是？幻想吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我什么时候去过沙漠了？什么时候又——呜——咳咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一股瘙痒带着热度，从胃里爬上胸腔，正挤入喉管。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像是一只毛茸茸的鸟，正扑腾着被打湿的羽毛，拼了命地想从她身体中钻出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>嗯……是药起作用了吗？感觉胃里已经好受多了，只是喉咙，好像……又烫又痒……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-307312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>呃——咳咳，呼——哈——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>咳咳——呃，呜呜……咔——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>哇呕——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我……我妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>可从来都没和我说过……我我我们家有喷火红龙的血统呀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>不——不、不不不……我现在就得去看医生！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RUG-01"}}